#5  Analog signal
===============================================================================================

  All our examples so far have made use of a certain type of current called static current:
    initial voltage -> current flow -> equilibrium
  This is what happens when you want to pet your cat and it goes clac clac.

  In electrical circuits there's usually a generator.
  Generator because it generates a voltage which, under the right conditions, can cause a current.
  Lithium batteries, nuclear power plants or dynamos are examples of generators.



